lass="cm-gutterElement" style="height: 38.3958px;">441</div><div class="cm-gutterElement" style="height: 19.1979px;">442</div><div class="cm-gutterElement" style="height: 38.3958px;">443</div><div class="cm-gutterElement" style="height: 38.3958px;">444</div><div class="cm-gutterElement" style="height: 38.3958px;">445</div><div class="cm-gutterElement" style="height: 57.5938px;">446</div><div class="cm-gutterElement" style="height: 19.1979px;">447</div></div><div class="cm-gutter cm-foldGutter"><div class="cm-gutterElement" style="height: 0px; visibility: hidden; pointer-events: none;"><span title="Unfold line">▸</span></div><div class="cm-gutterElement" style="height: 19.1979px; margin-top: 9065.42px;"><span title="Fold line">▾</span></div></div><div class="cm-gutter cm-gutter-lint"></div></div><div spellcheck="false" autocorrect="off" autocapitalize="off" writingsuggestions="false" translate="no" contenteditable="true" class="cm-content cm-lineWrapping" role="textbox" aria-multiline="true" style="tab-size: 4; --half-leading: 3.6px; padding-bottom: 465.802px;" aria-label="Source Editor editing" data-language="latex" aria-autocomplete="list"><div class="cm-gap" style="height: 8466.28px;"></div><div class="cm-line"><span class="tok-typeName">\texttt</span><span class="tok-punctuation">{</span><span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">iptables</span><span class="tok-punctuation">}</span> a <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">été</span> <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">validé</span> <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">dans</span> <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">un</span> <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">scénario</span> de test <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">contrôlé</span>.</div><div class="cm-line"><img class="cm-widgetBuffer" aria-hidden="true"><span class="ol-cm-filler" contenteditable="false"></span><br></div><div class="cm-line"><span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">Enfin</span>, <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">les</span> <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">différentes</span> <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">étapes</span> <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">ont</span> <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">été</span> <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">intégrées</span> <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">dans</span> <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">un</span> pipeline <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">automatisé</span> <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">allant</span> </div><div class="cm-line"><span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">du</span> <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">fichier</span> <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">PCAP</span> <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">jusqu'au</span> scoring, <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">au</span> <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">stockage</span> <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">des</span> <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">résultats</span> et <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">à</span> la <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">réponse</span> </div><div class="cm-line"><span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">contrôlée</span>. Le <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">projet</span> <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">constitue</span> <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">ainsi</span> <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">une</span> <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">preuve</span> de concept <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">fonctionnelle</span> <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">démontrant</span> </div><div class="cm-line"><span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">l'intérêt</span> de combiner <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">détection</span> <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">d'anomalies</span>, <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">analyse</span> <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">contextuelle</span>, <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">détection</span> par </div><div class="cm-line">signatures, <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">visualisation</span> et <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">réponse</span> <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">automatisée</span> <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">dans</span> <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">une</span> architecture <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">NDR</span>.</div><div class="cm-line"><img class="cm-widgetBuffer" aria-hidden="true"><span class="ol-cm-filler" contenteditable="false"></span><br></div><div class="cm-line"><span class="tok-typeName">\medskip</span></div><div class="cm-line"><img class="cm-widgetBuffer" aria-hidden="true"><span class="ol-cm-filler" contenteditable="false"></span><br></div><div class="cm-line"><span class="tok-typeName">\noindent</span></div><div class="cm-line"><span class="tok-typeName">\textbf</span><span class="tok-punctuation">{</span>Mots-<span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">clés</span> :<span class="tok-punctuation">}</span> <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">NDR</span>, <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">cybersécurité</span>, <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">sécurité</span> <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">réseau</span>, Isolation Forest, <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">Zeek</span>, </div><div class="cm-line"><span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">Suricata</span>, PostgreSQL, <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">Grafana</span>, Python, <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">réponse</span> <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">automatisée</span>.</div><div class="cm-line"><img class="cm-widgetBuffer" aria-hidden="true"><span class="ol-cm-filler" contenteditable="false"></span><br></div><div class="cm-line"><img class="cm-widgetBuffer" aria-hidden="true"><span class="ol-cm-filler" contenteditable="false"></span><br></div><div class="cm-line"><span class="tok-comment">% ============================================================</span></div><div class="cm-line"><span class="tok-comment">% ABSTRACT</span></div><div class="cm-line"><span class="tok-comment">% ============================================================</span></div><div class="cm-line"><img class="cm-widgetBuffer" aria-hidden="true"><span class="ol-cm-filler" contenteditable="false"></span><br></div><div class="cm-line"><span class="tok-typeName">\chapter</span>*<span class="tok-punctuation">{</span>Abstract<span class="tok-punctuation">}</span></div><div class="cm-line"><span class="tok-typeName">\addcontentsline</span><span class="tok-punctuation">{</span><span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">toc</span><span class="tok-punctuation">}</span><span class="tok-punctuation">{</span>chapter<span class="tok-punctuation">}</span><span class="tok-punctuation">{</span>Abstract<span class="tok-punctuation">}</span></div><div class="cm-line"><img class="cm-widgetBuffer" aria-hidden="true"><span class="ol-cm-filler" contenteditable="false"></span><br></div><div class="cm-line">As part of my internship at <span class="tok-typeName">\textbf</span><span class="tok-punctuation">{</span>Atlas Cloud Services (ACS)<span class="tok-punctuation">}</span>, I worked on the </div><div class="cm-line">design and prototyping of a <span class="tok-typeName">\textit</span><span class="tok-punctuation">{</span>Network Detection and Response<span class="tok-punctuation">}</span> (<span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">NDR</span>) solution </div><div class="cm-line">dedicated to network traffic monitoring and analysis.</div><div class="cm-line"><img class="cm-widgetBuffer" aria-hidden="true"><span class="ol-cm-filler" contenteditable="false"></span><br></div><div class="cm-line">The objective of the project was to develop a proof of concept capable of collecting </div><div class="cm-line">network traffic, extracting relevant information, detecting unusual <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">behaviours</span>, </div><div class="cm-line"><span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">contextualising</span> them and assigning a risk level to observed events.</div><div class="cm-line"><img class="cm-widgetBuffer" aria-hidden="true"><span class="ol-cm-filler" contenteditable="false"></span><br></div><div class="cm-line">A <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">virtualised</span> laboratory environment based on Ubuntu Server was deployed. Network </div><div class="cm-line">traffic was captured using <span class="tok-typeName">\texttt</span><span class="tok-punctuation">{</span><span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">tcpdump</span><span class="tok-punctuation">}</span> and stored in <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">PCAP</span> files. <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">TShark</span> was </div><div class="cm-line">then used to extract relevant network information in a structured format. After </div><div class="cm-line">data <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">preprocessing</span> and <span class="tok-typeName">\textit</span><span class="tok-punctuation">{</span>Feature Engineering<span class="tok-punctuation">}</span>, an <span class="tok-typeName">\textit</span><span class="tok-punctuation">{</span>Isolation Forest<span class="tok-punctuation">}</span> </div><div class="cm-line">model was trained to identify unusual observations.</div><div class="cm-line"><img class="cm-widgetBuffer" aria-hidden="true"><span class="ol-cm-filler" contenteditable="false"></span><br></div><div class="cm-line">Detected anomalies were then correlated with contextual information provided by </div><div class="cm-line"><span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">Zeek</span>, particularly for the analysis of SSH connections. <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">Suricata</span> was used in </div><div class="cm-line">parallel as a rule- and signature-based intrusion detection engine. Information </div><div class="cm-line">provided by these different components was then used by a <span class="tok-typeName">\textit</span><span class="tok-punctuation">{</span>Risk Scoring<span class="tok-punctuation">}</span> </div><div class="cm-line">mechanism to classify events into four levels: low, medium, high and critical.</div><div class="cm-line"><img class="cm-widgetBuffer" aria-hidden="true"><span class="ol-cm-filler" contenteditable="false"></span><br></div><div class="cm-line">The results are automatically stored in PostgreSQL and <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">visualised</span> through a <span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">Grafana</span> </div><div class="cm-line">dashboard including an alerting mechanism. A controlled automated response engine </div><div class="cm-line">was also developed. It operates by default in <span class="tok-typeName">\texttt</span><span class="tok-punctuation">{</span>DRY<span class="tok-literal">\_</span>RUN<span class="tok-punctuation">}</span> mode, while an </div><div class="cm-line"><span class="tok-typeName">\texttt</span><span class="tok-punctuation">{</span>ENFORCE<span class="tok-punctuation">}</span> mode based on <span class="tok-typeName">\texttt</span><span class="tok-punctuation">{</span><span class="ol-cm-spelling-error">iptables</span><span class="tok-punctuation">}</span> was successfully validated in a </div><div class="cm-line">controlled test scenario.</div><div class="cm-gap" style="height: 345.563px;"></div><div class="cm-line">Suricata, PostgreSQL, Grafana, Python, automated response.</div><div class="cm-gap" style="height: 60972.6px;"></div></div><div class="cm-layer cm-layer-above cm-cursorLayer" aria-hidden="true" style="z-index: 150; animation-duration: 1200ms; animation-name: cm-blink;"><div class="cm-cursor cm-cursor-primary" style="left: 199.031px; top: 10370.6px; height: 19.19px;"></div></div><div class="cm-layer cm-selectionLayer" aria-hidden="true" style="z-index: -2;"></div><div class="cm-layer cm-layer-above ol-cm-cursorHighlightsLayer" aria-hidden="true" style="z-index: 148;"></div><div class="cm-layer ol-cm-activeLineLayer" aria-hidden="true" style="z-index: -4;"><div class="cm-activeLine" style="left: 55.6563px; top: 10370.6px; width: 351.677px; height: 19.19px;"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><div class="" role="separator" tabindex="0" data-panel-group-direction="horizontal" data-panel-group-id=":r14:" data-resize-handle="" data-resize-handle-state="inactive" data-panel-resize-handle-enabled="true" data-panel-resize-handle-id