ound(down, var(--total-scale-factor) * 841.89px, var(--scale-round-y));" data-listening-for-double-click="true"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 35.85%; top: 43.92%; font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *24.79px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(1.19316);">CHAPITRE 9</span><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 17.58%; top: 51.36%; font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *24.79px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(1.11907);">Alerting et réponse automatisée</span><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 41.2%; top: 55.76%; font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *24.79px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(1.08317);">contrôlée</span><div class="endOfContent"></div></div><div class="annotationLayer" hidden=""></div></div><div class="page" data-page-number="56" data-l10n-id="pdfjs-page-landmark" data-l10n-args="{&quot;page&quot;:56}" style="width: round(down, var(--total-scale-factor) * 595.276px, var(--scale-round-x)); height: round(down, var(--total-scale-factor) * 841.89px, var(--scale-round-y)); --scale-round-x: 2px; --scale-round-y: 2px;" aria-label="Page ⁨56⁩" data-loaded="true"><div class="canvasWrapper"><canvas role="presentation" width="819" height="1161"></canvas></div><div tabindex="0" class="textLayer" data-main-rotation="0" style="width: round(down, var(--total-scale-factor) * 595.276px, var(--scale-round-x)); height: round(down, var(--total-scale-factor) * 841.89px, var(--scale-round-y));" data-listening-for-double-click="true"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 12.86%; top: 4.08%; font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *11.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(0.998751);">Projet de Fin d’Année</span><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 32.14%; top: 4.08%; font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *11.96px); font-family: sans-serif;"> </span><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 67.79%; top: 4.08%; font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *11.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(0.94777);">NDR – Sécurité Réseau</span><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 12.86%; top: 9.01%; font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *17.22px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(1.03439);">9.1</span><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 17.01%; top: 9.01%; font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *17.22px); font-family: sans-serif;"> </span><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 20.27%; top: 9.01%; font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *17.22px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(1.18511);">Introduction</span><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 15.81%; top: 13.05%; font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *11.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(0.965422);">La détection et la visualisation d’un événement représentent une première étape.</span><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 15.81%; top: 15.18%; font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *11.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(0.926208);">Dans une architecture NDR, il est également nécessaire de pouvoir signaler rapidement</span><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 12.86%; top: 17.31%; font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *11.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(0.925787);">les événements importants et, lorsque cela est pertinent, déclencher une action de réponse.</span><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 12.86%; top: 22.12%; font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *17.22px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(1.03439);">9.2</span><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 17.01%; top: 22.12%; font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *17.22px); font-family: sans-serif;"> </span><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 20.27%; top: 22.12%; font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *17.22px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(1.11503);">Mécanisme d’alerting Grafana</span><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 15.81%; top: 26.17%; font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *11.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(0.954528);">Une règle d’alerte a été configurée dans Grafana sous le nom :</span><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 38.75%; top: 29.45%; font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *11.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(0.964461);">Alerte NDR – Risque élevé</span><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 15.81%; top: 32.72%; font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *11.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(0.92782);">Le principe consiste à surveiller le score maximal présent dans les événements stockés.</span><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 15.81%; top: 34.85%; font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *11.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(0.978226);">La condition retenue est :</span><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 43.32%; top: 39.11%; font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *11.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(1.1405);">risk</span><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 46.95%; top: 39.11%; font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *11.96px); font-family: sans-serif;">_</span><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 48.42%; top: 39.11%; font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *11.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(0.930977);">score</span><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 52.99%; top: 39.11%; font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *11.96px); font-family: sans-serif;"> </span><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 53.55%; top: 39.11%; font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *11.96px); font-family: sans-serif;">≥</span><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 55.11%; top: 39.11%; font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *11.96px); font-family: sans-serif;"> </span><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 55.67%; top: 39.11%; font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *11.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(0.880772);">50</span><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 15.81%; top: 42.2%; font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *11.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(0.967679);">Ainsi, un événement classé ÉLEVÉ ou CRITIQUE peut provoquer le déclenchement</span><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 12.86%; top: 44.33%; font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *11.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(0.979036);">de l’alerte.</span><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 25.33%; top: 78.92%; font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *11.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(1.16264);">Figure 9.1</span><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 35.84%; top: 78.92%; font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *11.96px); font-family: sans-serif;"> </span><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 36.49%; top: 78.92%; font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *11.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(0.94518);">– Règle d’alerting basée sur le score de risque</span><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 12.86%; top: 84.24%; font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *17.22px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(1.03439);">9.3</span><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 17.01%; top: 84.24%; font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *17.22px); font-family: sans-serif;"> </span><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 20.27%; top: 84.24%; font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *17.22px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(1.12355);">Validation du mécanisme d’alerte</span><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 15.81%; top: 88.29%; font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *11.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(0.983152);">Afin de tester le système sans modifier les données réelles, un événement artificiel</span><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 12.86%; top: 90.42%; font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *11.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(0.946298);">avec un score de 60 a été temporairement inséré.</span><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 49.49%; top: 93.97%; font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *11.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(0.880772);">55</span><div class="endOfContent"></div></div><div class="annotationLayer" hidden=""></div></div><div class="page" data-page-number="57" data-l10n-id="pdfjs-page-landmark" data-l10n-args="{&quot;page&quot;:57}" style="width: round(down, var(--total-scale-factor) * 595.276px, var(--scale-round-x)); height: round(down, var(--total-scale-factor) * 841.89px, var(--scale-round-y)); --scale-round-x: 2px; --scale-round-y: 2px;" aria-label="Page ⁨57⁩" data-loaded="true"><div class="canvasWrapper"><canvas role="presentation" width="819" height="1161"></canvas></div><div tabindex="0" class="textLayer" data-main-rotation="0" style="width: round(down, var(--total-scale-factor) * 595.276px, var(--scale-round-x)); height: round(down, var(--total-scale-factor) * 841.89px, var(--scale-round-y));" data-listening-for-double-click="true"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 12.86%; top: 4.08%; font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *11.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(0.998751);">Projet de Fin d’Année</span><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 32.14%; top: 4.08%; font-size: calc(var(--t