--total-scale-factor) *11.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(1.14823);">Normal</span><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 15.81%; top: 16.01%; font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *11.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(1.07543);">L’état</span><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 20.97%; top: 16.01%; font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *11.96px); font-family: sans-serif;"> </span><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 21.62%; top: 16.01%; font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *11.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(1.06068);">Firing</span><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 26.95%; top: 16.01%; font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *11.96px); font-family: sans-serif;"> </span><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 27.71%; top: 16.01%; font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *11.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(0.954146);">a été obtenu après l’insertion de l’événement à risque élevé.</span><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 15.81%; top: 18.14%; font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *11.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(0.963478);">Après suppression de l’événement de test, l’alerte est revenue à l’état normal.</span><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 15.81%; top: 20.27%; font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *11.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(0.96917);">Cette expérimentation permet de valider le fonctionnement du mécanisme d’alerting.</span><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 25.03%; top: 51.94%; font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *11.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(1.16264);">Figure 9.2</span><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: 35.53%; top: 51.94%; font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *11.96px); font-family: sans